    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your controller just became an instrument.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your controller just became an instrument. SONGBOY is the first video game for making music. Grab your controller and craft songs in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013320/extras/08f191c63b7c04037ca9bc294b3cbfcc.avif?t=1754926325\" width=1400 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built to be explored.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned producer or someone who's always wanted to create, SONGBOY meets you where you are. Make trap, house, indie, pop, or invent something entirely new. Your controller. Your sound. Your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller-Native Creation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with any controller out of the box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feels like second nature from the first beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound amazing in your first session</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional Output</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio-grade results from intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export stems to your DAW or share with the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real music, made through play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect For</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamers</strong> who love to make music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Producers</strong> seeking faster/unique workflows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anyone</strong> who's felt locked out by traditional tools</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your controller just became an instrument.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your controller just became an instrument. SONGBOY is the first video game for making music. Grab your controller and craft songs in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013320/extras/08f191c63b7c04037ca9bc294b3cbfcc.avif?t=1754926325\" width=1400 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built to be explored.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned producer or someone who's always wanted to create, SONGBOY meets you where you are. Make trap, house, indie, pop, or invent something entirely new. Your controller. Your sound. Your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller-Native Creation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with any controller out of the box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feels like second nature from the first beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound amazing in your first session</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional Output</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio-grade results from intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export stems to your DAW or share with the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real music, made through play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect For</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamers</strong> who love to make music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Producers</strong> seeking faster/unique workflows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anyone</strong> who's felt locked out by traditional tools</p></li></ul>",
